{"seq":3,"slug":"neural-ranking","title":"神经排序模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/ranking/neural-ranking","wordCount":943,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"神经排序模型\">神经排序模型</h1><p>神经排序模型（Neural Ranking Models）将深度学习引入信息检索排序层，通过预训练语言模型捕获词法匹配之外的语义理解能力。以 BERT 为代表的 Transformer 模型在 MS MARCO 等基准上大幅超越 BM25，推动搜索进入「神经时代」。本篇聚焦四类主流架构：BERT Reranker、ColBERT、SPLADE，以及 cross-encoder vs bi-encoder 的工程选型决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Neural[神经排序模型]&#10;    Neural --&gt; CrossEnc[Cross-Encoder\\n全注意力交互]&#10;    Neural --&gt; BiEnc[Bi-Encoder\\n双塔独立编码]&#10;    Neural --&gt; Late[Late Interaction\\n后期交互]&#10;    Neural --&gt; Sparse[Learned Sparse\\n学习稀疏]&#10;&#10;    CrossEnc --&gt; BERT[BERT Reranker\\nmonoBERT/duoBERT]&#10;    BiEnc --&gt; DPR[DPR/ANCE\\n向量检索]&#10;    Late --&gt; ColBERT[ColBERT\\nMaxSim聚合]&#10;    Sparse --&gt; SPLADE[SPLADE\\n扩展倒排索引]\">graph TD\n    Neural[神经排序模型]\n    Neural --&gt; CrossEnc[Cross-Encoder\\n全注意力交互]\n    Neural --&gt; BiEnc[Bi-Encoder\\n双塔独立编码]\n    Neural --&gt; Late[Late Interaction\\n后期交互]\n    Neural --&gt; Sparse[Learned Sparse\\n学习稀疏]\n\n    CrossEnc --&gt; BERT[BERT Reranker\\nmonoBERT/duoBERT]\n    BiEnc --&gt; DPR[DPR/ANCE\\n向量检索]\n    Late --&gt; ColBERT[ColBERT\\nMaxSim聚合]\n    Sparse --&gt; SPLADE[SPLADE\\n扩展倒排索引]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>适用阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cross-Encoder（BERT Reranker）</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最慢（O(n)推理）</td>\n<td>精排（Top-100 → Top-10）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bi-Encoder（DPR）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>最快（ANN 检索）</td>\n<td>召回阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Late Interaction（ColBERT）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>较快（预计算）</td>\n<td>精排/中间层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Learned Sparse（SPLADE）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>快（倒排索引）</td>\n<td>召回 + 轻量精排</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"bert-reranker-cross-encoder-深度交互\">BERT Reranker：Cross-Encoder 深度交互</h2><p>Cross-Encoder 将查询和文档拼接后输入 BERT，让两者之间产生完全的注意力交互：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入: [CLS] query tokens [SEP] document tokens [SEP]&#10;输出: [CLS] 向量 → 线性层 → 相关性得分\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入: [CLS] query tokens [SEP] document tokens [SEP]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出: [CLS] 向量 → 线性层 → 相关性得分</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>monoBERT</strong>（Nogueira &amp; Cho, 2019）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 简化的 BERT Reranker 推理&#10;from transformers import AutoTokenizer, AutoModelForSequenceClassification&#10;import torch&#10;&#10;tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(&quot;cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2&quot;)&#10;model = AutoModelForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained(&#10;    &quot;cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;def rerank(query: str, passages: list[str]) -&gt; list[float]:&#10;    inputs = tokenizer(&#10;        [[query, p] for p in passages],&#10;        padding=True, truncation=True, max_length=512, return_tensors=&quot;pt&quot;&#10;    )&#10;    with torch.no_grad():&#10;        scores = model(**inputs).logits.squeeze(-1)&#10;    return scores.tolist()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 简化的 BERT Reranker 推理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoTokenizer, AutoModelForSequenceClassification</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokenizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rerank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, passages: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) -> list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    inputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokenizer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        [[query, p] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> passages],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">truncation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">return_tensors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pt\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        scores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">inputs).logits.squeeze(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scores.tolist()</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>效果 vs 延迟权衡</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>MS MARCO MRR@10</th>\n<th>推理时间（单 query，GPU）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>BM25</td>\n<td>18.4</td>\n<td>&lt;1ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>monoBERT (BERT-base)</td>\n<td>36.4</td>\n<td>~50ms/100候选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MiniLM-L-6 Cross-Encoder</td>\n<td>34.5</td>\n<td>~5ms/100候选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BERT-Large Cross-Encoder</td>\n<td>38.0</td>\n<td>~200ms/100候选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实际部署时通常用 <strong>cascaded reranking</strong>：BM25 召回 1000 → MiniLM 精排 100 → Large BERT 精排 10。</p>\n<h2 id=\"colbert-late-interaction-后期交互\">ColBERT：Late Interaction 后期交互</h2><p>ColBERT（Khattab &amp; Zaharia, 2020）在 bi-encoder 效率和 cross-encoder 效果之间找到了平衡：查询和文档独立编码，但通过 <strong>MaxSim</strong> 在 token 级别进行后期交互。</p>\n<p><strong>核心创新</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"查询编码: Q = BERT_q([CLS], q_1, q_2, ..., q_m) → Q ∈ R^{m×d}&#10;文档编码: D = BERT_d([CLS], d_1, d_2, ..., d_n) → D ∈ R^{n×d}&#10;&#10;MaxSim 聚合:&#10;  score(q, d) = Σ_{i∈[m]} max_{j∈[n]} (Q_i · D_j)&#10;&#10;  对每个查询 token，找与它余弦相似度最高的文档 token，求和\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>查询编码: Q = BERT_q([CLS], q_1, q_2, ..., q_m) → Q ∈ R^{m×d}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>文档编码: D = BERT_d([CLS], d_1, d_2, ..., d_n) → D ∈ R^{n×d}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MaxSim 聚合:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  score(q, d) = Σ_{i∈[m]} max_{j∈[n]} (Q_i · D_j)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  对每个查询 token，找与它余弦相似度最高的文档 token，求和</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>工程优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>文档向量在索引期预计算，存入向量数据库</li>\n<li>查询期只需编码查询（轻量），然后做近似 MaxSim 计算</li>\n<li>效果接近 Cross-Encoder，延迟仅 bi-encoder 的 2-3 倍</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>ColBERTv2</strong> 改进：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>压缩每个 token 向量（残差量化），将存储开销降低 6-8 倍</li>\n<li>在 BEIR 基准上达到 state-of-the-art</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"splade-学习稀疏扩展\">SPLADE：学习稀疏扩展</h2><p>SPLADE（Formal et al., 2021）利用 BERT 的 MLM（Masked Language Model）头，为每个词项学习一个扩展权重，生成稀疏但语义丰富的 bag-of-words 表示，直接兼容倒排索引：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入文档: &quot;python web development&quot;&#10;&#10;SPLADE 扩展权重（top tokens）：&#10;  python: 2.8, programming: 1.9, code: 1.7, django: 1.5,&#10;  flask: 1.3, web: 2.1, development: 2.0, framework: 1.6,&#10;  scripting: 0.8, ...&#10;  (大量零权重词项不存储)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入文档: \"python web development\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>SPLADE 扩展权重（top tokens）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  python: 2.8, programming: 1.9, code: 1.7, django: 1.5,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  flask: 1.3, web: 2.1, development: 2.0, framework: 1.6,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  scripting: 0.8, ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (大量零权重词项不存储)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>与传统稀疏方法的对比</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>词项来源</th>\n<th>扩展能力</th>\n<th>索引兼容性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>BM25</td>\n<td>文档原文词项</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>完全兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Doc2Query</td>\n<td>T5 生成假设查询词</td>\n<td>有（生成式）</td>\n<td>兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SPLADE</td>\n<td>BERT MLM 权重学习</td>\n<td>有（判别式）</td>\n<td>兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ColBERT</td>\n<td>BERT dense 向量</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>需向量数据库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>SPLADE 的最大工程优势是<strong>无需向量数据库</strong>，直接用现有 Elasticsearch/Solr 倒排索引服务，显著降低部署复杂度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cross-encoder-vs-bi-encoder-工程选型指南\">Cross-Encoder vs Bi-Encoder：工程选型指南</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Query[用户查询] --&gt; BiEnc[Bi-Encoder 召回\\nANN向量检索]&#10;    BiEnc --&gt; TopK[Top-K 候选\\nK=100~1000]&#10;    TopK --&gt; CrossEnc[Cross-Encoder 精排]&#10;    CrossEnc --&gt; FinalList[最终排序列表]\">graph LR\n    Query[用户查询] --&gt; BiEnc[Bi-Encoder 召回\\nANN向量检索]\n    BiEnc --&gt; TopK[Top-K 候选\\nK=100~1000]\n    TopK --&gt; CrossEnc[Cross-Encoder 精排]\n    CrossEnc --&gt; FinalList[最终排序列表]</pre><p><strong>决策树</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>需求</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟 &lt;10ms，规模 &gt;1000万</td>\n<td>Bi-Encoder (DPR/ANCE)</td>\n<td>ANN 检索天然低延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效果优先，候选集 &lt;500</td>\n<td>Cross-Encoder (monoBERT)</td>\n<td>最高质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效果与延迟平衡</td>\n<td>ColBERT / SPLADE + Cross-Encoder 两阶段</td>\n<td>工业主流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无向量数据库基础设施</td>\n<td>SPLADE</td>\n<td>兼容倒排索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多语言场景</td>\n<td>mDPR / multilingual-E5</td>\n<td>多语言预训练</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>延迟优化技术</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>量化（Quantization）</strong>：INT8 量化可降低延迟约 2-4 倍，效果损失 &lt;1%</li>\n<li><strong>知识蒸馏（Distillation）</strong>：将 BERT-Large 蒸馏到 MiniLM-L-6（6层），延迟降低 8 倍</li>\n<li><strong>ONNX Runtime / TensorRT</strong>：推理引擎优化，额外 1.5-3 倍加速</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Cross-Encoder</strong>（BERT Reranker）效果最佳，但推理成本高，适合精排 Top-100 以内的候选集</li>\n<li><strong>ColBERT</strong> 在 token 级后期交互中取得效果与效率的良好平衡，是当前学术界热点</li>\n<li><strong>SPLADE</strong> 兼容倒排索引，是从词法系统向神经系统迁移的最低成本路径</li>\n<li>工业系统通常采用<strong>多阶段流水线</strong>：BM25/Bi-Encoder 召回 → SPLADE 或 ColBERT 中间精排 → Cross-Encoder 最终精排</li>\n<li>延迟优化三板斧：量化 + 蒸馏 + 推理引擎（ONNX/TRT）</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>章内延伸</strong>：LTR（本章第 2 篇）可以将 ColBERT/SPLADE 得分作为特征输入 LambdaMART，形成混合排序体系；评测指标（第 4 章第 1 篇）是衡量神经模型提升效果的标准工具。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"神经排序模型","id":"神经排序模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"BERT Reranker：Cross-Encoder 深度交互","id":"bert-reranker-cross-encoder-深度交互"},{"level":2,"text":"ColBERT：Late Interaction 后期交互","id":"colbert-late-interaction-后期交互"},{"level":2,"text":"SPLADE：学习稀疏扩展","id":"splade-学习稀疏扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"Cross-Encoder vs Bi-Encoder：工程选型指南","id":"cross-encoder-vs-bi-encoder-工程选型指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"排序学习 (Learning to Rank)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/ranking/learning-to-rank"},"next":{"title":"搜索引擎核心架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/systems/search-engine-architecture"}}